  "helpEffortTitle": "Effort",
  "helpEffortBody": "Right after you tick a set, the app asks how hard it was, above the rest timer while you rest. It's optional: skip it, or pick another set. When no rest starts, it also goes away after a few seconds. To answer later or change it, select the done set. Warm-ups aren't rated.",
